    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "NEW PHASE LAUNCHING 8TH OCTOBER 2026!\r\n\r\nOak Grove, Bunclody, is a new residential development of High Quality Spacious Homes situated in the grounds of Bunclody Golf & Fishing Club, right in the heart of Bunclody town. \r\nA well planned private residential development of large 3 & 4 bedroom detached homes built to a high specification with new look, contemporary aesthetics. The 'A' Rated Building Energy Rating will ensure these new homes are not only stylish but exceptionally energy efficient, with low running costs.\r\nBunclody offers a choice of primary and secondary schools, churches, soccer and Gaelic clubs, swimming pool, golf course, shopping, restaurants and leisure facilities a truly community grounded neighbourhood and located approximately 100 km from the M50, Oak Grove is within easy commuting distance of Dublin while Gorey and Carlow towns are little more than 30 km away."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>\"A\" Energy Rated Homes.</li><li>Low carbon sustainable timer frame builds with block outer leaf.</li><li>PV panels fitted.</li><li>All homes fully detached.</li><li>Qualifies for Help to Buy Scheme</li><li>Air to Water heat pump system provies domestic hot water and efficient heating.</li><li>Heat recovery ventilation unit.</li><li>Energy-efficient double glazed windows and doors.</li><li>Interior fully painted in a subtle contemporary colour.</li><li>Driveways set with stylish cobble paving.</li><li>Contemporary fitted kitchen.</li><li>Quality bathroom suites.</li><li>Power showers in ensuite and main bathroom</li><li>Generous Electrical /TV wiring specification.</li><li>Gardens seeded.</li><li>Wired for electric vehicle charging point (charging point not included).</li><li>Wired for a change over switch for use with generator (generator not provided).</li><li>10 year Homebond Guarantee.</li></ul>"
      },
      {
